# docs/CURATED_SET.md §1 fight 6 — Destroy. The review's worst opener, reborn.
#
# The gate is an 8 HP structure that attacks cannot touch at all. The only thing that hurts it is a
# collision — 2 per slam, four slams — so to win you have to throw bodies at it, which means the
# enemy is your ammunition. That is the game's thesis stated as a win condition.
#
# The Warden under the gate is the complication: Move 0, so unlike the Anchors it replaced it will
# still be standing in the gap on round 4. It is push-resistant, but a STAGGERED Warden moves — so
# collide a Husk from the reinforcement waves into him and he becomes the battering ram.
#
# Coordinates are x,y with 0,0 top-left. §6 authors 'destroy 1,3' but its own D mark sits at 3,1 and
# the Warden sits directly beneath it — the board is authoritative (DECISIONS.md D-042).
#
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot       D  the destroy structure

id: break-the-gate
number: 6
name: Break the Gate
description: An eight-hit-point gate that only collisions can dent, and a Warden holding the gap who becomes your battering ram the moment he is staggered.

spawn l = Lobber
spawn w = Warden
spawn h = Husk

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

objective: destroy 3,1

wave 2 = h@1,0 h@5,0

board:
  .l...l.
  ###D###
  ..^w^..
  ...H...
  .......
  A.....B
  AA...BB
